{"3129150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Chillers: The Chat Room", "steam_appid": 3129150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It was all fun and games... until <i>DEATH</i> logged in!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/extras/e1e12448c9c35a0c409b85e83df02f3a.avif?t=1787855725\" width=500 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Be careful around strangers today…</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Nari's school, everyone's talking about a mysterious chat room posting horoscopes with impossible accuracy… predicting things before they happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when the predictions turn dark and murders start occurring, Nari realizes the horoscopes might be more than just creepy coincidences. As the deadly patterns unfold, Nari must uncover the truth before the next prediction is about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a small town gone wrong, meet a cast of classic 90s archetypes, and dig through clues one dot-matrix printout at a time…  all while the killer stays one step ahead. <strong>Super Chillers: The Chat Room</strong> is a campy love letter to the YA horror paperbacks of the 80s &amp; 90s like Fear Street and Point Horror that taught an entire generation to trust no one and to always check the closet before bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/extras/1f25535f7db8d475d4ba76c64e2d1e33.avif?t=1787855725\" width=500 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Log into the Third Eye BBS, </strong> an early 1990s chat room posting horoscopes that come eerily true. Read between the lines before the next prediction comes for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Nari Moon</strong>, an ordinary teen with a soft spot for horoscopes and New Age stuff… right up until the predictions start coming true, and she's pulled into a mystery she never asked for.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings, one point of no return.</strong>  How you play decides which ending you get.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced cast </strong>brings the characters to life with English voice performances, wrapped in classic pixel art environments straight out of a Point Horror paperback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-school point-and-click puzzles:</strong> search, connect clues, and survive long enough to catch the killer before they catch you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It was all fun and games... until <i>DEATH</i> logged in!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/extras/e1e12448c9c35a0c409b85e83df02f3a.avif?t=1787855725\" width=500 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Be careful around strangers today…</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Nari's school, everyone's talking about a mysterious chat room posting horoscopes with impossible accuracy… predicting things before they happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when the predictions turn dark and murders start occurring, Nari realizes the horoscopes might be more than just creepy coincidences. As the deadly patterns unfold, Nari must uncover the truth before the next prediction is about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a small town gone wrong, meet a cast of classic 90s archetypes, and dig through clues one dot-matrix printout at a time…  all while the killer stays one step ahead. <strong>Super Chillers: The Chat Room</strong> is a campy love letter to the YA horror paperbacks of the 80s &amp; 90s like Fear Street and Point Horror that taught an entire generation to trust no one and to always check the closet before bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/extras/1f25535f7db8d475d4ba76c64e2d1e33.avif?t=1787855725\" width=500 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Log into the Third Eye BBS, </strong> an early 1990s chat room posting horoscopes that come eerily true. Read between the lines before the next prediction comes for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Nari Moon</strong>, an ordinary teen with a soft spot for horoscopes and New Age stuff… right up until the predictions start coming true, and she's pulled into a mystery she never asked for.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings, one point of no return.</strong>  How you play decides which ending you get.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced cast </strong>brings the characters to life with English voice performances, wrapped in classic pixel art environments straight out of a Point Horror paperback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-school point-and-click puzzles:</strong> search, connect clues, and survive long enough to catch the killer before they catch you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Travel back to the 90s in this campy point-and-click horror adventure inspired by classic YA horror books like Fear Street and Point Horror.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/5077bc541c7f6de3c676ab035d467083dc52055e/header.jpg?t=1787855725", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/aa63bbca4d93551a750f7069924b30f82d0e0d51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787855725", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/aa63bbca4d93551a750f7069924b30f82d0e0d51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787855725", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256mb<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Rose Arcana Games"], "publ